1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,432
Kenapa bau durian

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:04,364
boleh sampai ke hujung lorong?

3
00:00:04,364 --> 00:00:05,891
Bau tu datang dari

4
00:00:05,891 --> 00:00:07,036
puluhan sebatian kimia

5
00:00:07,036 --> 00:00:08,727
dalam isi dia.

6
00:00:08,727 --> 00:00:10,255
Ada yang mengandungi sulfur,

7
00:00:10,255 --> 00:00:11,400
keluarga bau bawang

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,091
dan telur busuk.

9
00:00:13,091 --> 00:00:15,000
Makin masak buah tu,

10
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,455
makin banyak bau dilepaskan.

11
00:00:17,455 --> 00:00:17,879
Kenapa?

12
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:19,152
Sebab dalam hutan,

13
00:00:19,152 --> 00:00:21,818
bau kuat ni panggil haiwan.

14
00:00:21,818 --> 00:00:23,091
Haiwan makan isinya,

15
00:00:23,091 --> 00:00:26,182
lepas tu bawa biji pergi jauh.

16
00:00:26,182 --> 00:00:28,303
Biji tumbuh jadi pokok baru.

17
00:00:28,303 --> 00:00:30,545
Bau tu sebenarnya... strategi!

18
00:00:30,545 --> 00:00:30,927
Tapi...

19
00:00:30,927 --> 00:00:32,836
bau yang sama ni juga

20
00:00:32,836 --> 00:00:34,909
buat durian kena larang.

21
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:36,436
Dalam hotel, dalam tren,

22
00:00:36,436 --> 00:00:39,273
ada papan tanda khas untuk dia!

23
00:00:39,273 --> 00:00:40,970
Orang lari bau dia...

24
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,636
tapi orang juga sanggup beratur.

25
00:00:43,636 --> 00:00:45,164
Bau sampai hujung lorong?

26
00:00:45,164 --> 00:00:48,000
Durian tu tengah buat kerja dia.

27
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,636
Kau team durian,

28
00:00:49,636 --> 00:00:52,364
atau team tutup hidung?
